:[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104430","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104430","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104430.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104430.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-21T12:05:23Z"},"body":"I profiled the launch of an empty project and noticed this little contributor:\r\n```\r\n122.00 ms  100,0 %\t8.00 ms\t   TextServerAdvanced::_shape_run(TextServerAdvanced::ShapedTextDataAdvanced*, long long, long long, hb_script_t, hb_direction_t, TypedArray<RID>, long long, long long, long long, long long, RID\r\n```\r\n\r\nIts contribution can be reduced by 5% (a few ms) by using an iterator pattern, removing these contributors:\r\n```\r\n5.00 ms   4,1 %\t0 s\t    Dictionary::values() const\r\n2.00 ms   1,6 %\t1.00 ms\t    Dictionary::keys() const\r\n1.00 ms   0,8 %\t1.00 ms\t    Array::~Array()\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Addendum\r\nIt would be interesting to change `glyphs` to `LocalVector` (from `Vector`) and resize it fittingly, avoiding reallocations, because that contribution is also large:\r\n```\r\n17.00 ms  13,9 %\t0 s\t    Vector<Glyph>::push_back(Glyph)\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, that's more effort, so it can be done some other time.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users